    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "A brave truth-seeker from Sikar exposed a critical leak when they emailed India's National Testing Agency, providing decisive evidence—a PDF that perfectly matched the chemistry paper. The agency acted decisively, referring the personnel involved to the CBI. The investigators who made the arrests swiftly cracked the case, resulting in the accountability of multiple individuals, including a prominent coaching figure. This victory for integrity forced the cancellation of the compromised medical entrance exam, paving the path to a fair re-test for all aspiring students.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Hero",
        "fragments": [
