          "how-3",
          "result-0",
          "result-2"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.95
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "The scheduled medical entrance exam was compromised, but the swift handoff of suspects to federal investigators marked a turning point. After receiving a tip-off email, the national examination authority initiated an investigation, leading to a crackdown that saw multiple arrests. This law enforcement action delivered accountability, a consequence that restored faith in the process. The resulting re-examination date set for June 21 stands as a second chance for justice, ensuring the integrity of the assessment for the nation's students.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Hero",
        "fragments": [
          "how-0",
          "how-1",
          "how-2",
          "how-3",
          "result-1",
          "result-2"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.88
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "In the arena where the battle for exam integrity is fought, a single courageous act unraveled a massive scandal. The brave truth-seeker provided the decisive evidence that broke the case open, leading to a referral of personnel for investigation. The central investigation agency moved to restore order, their arrests carried out as a direct consequence. This confrontation with corruption ended in a clear victory for integrity that forced a cancellation, setting the stage for a rescheduled, untainted examination on June 21.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Hero",
